# Phase 9: Budget & Trip Optimization Engine

## Objective

Enable TIE to construct plans within user constraints.

## Activities

Calculate:

```text
Transport cost
+
Accommodation
+
Activities
+
Other bookable services
+
Applicable fees
=
Estimated trip cost
```

Track:

```text
Total Budget
Committed Cost
Remaining Budget
```

### Optimization

Support constraints such as:

```text
Budget ≤ X

Travel date = Y

Travellers = N

Preferred category = Z
