# Phase 11: Prompt & Context Engineering

## Objective

Create reliable prompts that constrain the LLM to Uthenga's verified information.

The prompt should establish:

```text
System Role

User Intent

Travel Context

Available Vendors

Availability

Budget

Constraints

Required Output Schema

Safety / Accuracy Rules
```

Critical rule:

> **The LLM must not invent services or marketplace facts.**

## Deliverables

* System prompts
* Trip planning prompts
* Recommendation prompts
* Conversational prompts
* Prompt versioning
* Prompt tests

## Gate

AI responses consistently use supplied marketplace data and conform to defined schemas.

