# Phase 12: Response Validation & Safety Layer

## Objective

Never allow an LLM response to directly control booking or financial operations.

## Validation pipeline

```text
LLM
 ↓
Schema Validation
 ↓
Business Validation
 ↓
Availability Check
 ↓
Price Check
 ↓
Date Check
 ↓
Booking Compatibility
 ↓
Approved Response
```

If invalid:

```text
Reject
 ↓
Re-query
or
 ↓
Regenerate
or
 ↓
Fallback
```

## Deliverables

* Response validator
* Schema validation
* Business validation
* Hallucination safeguards
* Booking safety checks

## Gate

No AI-generated recommendation can produce an invalid booking state.

