# Phase Completion Standard

Every phase should follow the same implementation cycle:

```text
1. Understand
      ↓
2. Inspect existing code
      ↓
3. Design
      ↓
4. Implement
      ↓
5. Test
      ↓
6. Integrate
      ↓
7. Validate
      ↓
8. Document
      ↓
9. Commit
      ↓
10. Move to next phase
```

The agent **must not silently jump over phases**.

Each completed phase should produce:

```text
Implementation
+
Tests
+
Documentation
+
Integration Notes
+
Known Limitations
+
Next-Phase Dependencies
```

